Did you press F5 to call for the magic wand?

Did you use the wand to copy the 't'?

Did you drop a 't' on the right side of the 's'?

Did you drop the letters together?

OK, here's what I would do.  I'd pick up the wand, point to the 't' and
press the space bar to copy the letter.  I'd set down the 't' and the wand.
Then I'd drop a 't' on the right side of the 's'.  Then I'd drop the 'a'
on the right side of "s t".  And the 'r' on the right side of "s t a".  And
finally the 't' on the right side of "s t a r".
